      '// Fade: the LED on pin 9 brightens and dims using PWM (analogWrite).\n\nint brightness = 0;\nint step = 5;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(9, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  analogWrite(9, brightness);\n  brightness += step;\n  if (brightness <= 0 || brightness >= 255) step = -step;\n  delay(30);\n}\n',
